      "description": "Oblique Strategies SE is a premium, distraction-free environment for the 1975 Brian Eno/Peter Schmidt cards. Optimized for modern workflows while remaining faithful to the analog soul of the original deck.\n\nOblique Strategies is a deck of cards, each with a thought-provoking phrase to break routine thinking and encourage fresh perspectives. This digital edition brings the original and new decks to your fingertips, in a sleek, minimalist style true to the classic design.\n\nKey Features:\n\n• 100+ original and new Oblique Strategies cards\n• Minimalist, distraction-free interface\n• Daily inspiration with Home Screen widgets\n• Works on iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, and Mac\n• Apple Watch app runs independently\n• VoiceOver support for accessibility\n• Shake your device for a new prompt\n• Long tap to repeat the last phrase\n• No data collected—privacy first\n\nWhether you’re making art, writing, composing music, or brainstorming, Oblique Strategies SE is your pocket tool for creative breakthroughs.\n\nOne card to change your entire perspective - get started now.",
